; Spec section 6.12: an access that would end past its region is a runtime
; error, before anything is read: the last 4 bytes of a virtio-mmio
; transport's first 512 are at 508, so a 4-byte read at 509 is out of
; range, not misaligned, since range is checked first. A transport takes
; 4-byte reads on every board; a 16550 takes only bytes.

(def main () int
  (let u (region_open (board_virtio) 512)
    (let a (region_read32 u 508)
      (region_read32 u 509))))
